@startuml MyBatis-Mapper-Binding流程
title MyBatis Mapper 绑定流程时序图
hide footbox

actor 用户 as User
participant ":SqlSession" as SqlSession
participant ":Configuration" as Config
participant ":MapperRegistry" as MapperRegistry
participant ":MapperProxyFactory" as MapperProxyFactory
participant ":MapperProxy" as MapperProxy
participant ":MapperMethod" as MapperMethod
participant ":CachingExecutor" as CachingExec
participant ":Executor" as Executor

== 1. 获取Mapper阶段：创建代理对象 ==

User -> SqlSession: getMapper(MapperInterface.class)
note right of User
  用户通过SqlSession
  获取Mapper接口的实例
  实际上是获取代理对象
end note
SqlSession -> Config: getMapper(type, sqlSession)
note right of SqlSession
  委托Configuration
  调用MapperRegistry处理
end note
Config -> MapperRegistry: getMapper(type)
note right of Config
  根据接口类型
  从knownMappers缓存中
  获取MapperProxyFactory
end note

MapperRegistry -> MapperProxyFactory: newInstance(sqlSession)
note right of MapperRegistry
  创建MapperProxy实例
end note
MapperProxyFactory -> MapperProxy: new MapperProxy(sqlSession, mapperInterface, methodCache)
note right of MapperProxyFactory
  初始化MapperProxy
  - 保存SqlSession引用
  - 保存Mapper接口
  - 初始化方法缓存
end note
MapperProxy --> MapperProxyFactory: mapperProxy
MapperProxyFactory --> SqlSession: mapperProxy
SqlSession --> User: mapperProxy (动态代理对象)
note right of User
  返回JDK动态代理对象
  实际类型是$Proxy$N
end note

== 2. 执行Mapper方法阶段：代理拦截 ==

User -> MapperProxy: mapper.method(params)
note right of User
  用户调用Mapper接口方法
  触发invoke拦截
end note
activate MapperProxy

alt 调用Object方法
    MapperProxy -> MapperProxy: equals/hashCode/toString
    note right of MapperProxy
      如果是Object的方法
      直接调用原始方法
    end note
    MapperProxy --> User: result

else 调用Mapper接口方法
    MapperProxy -> MapperProxy: cachedInvoker(method)
    note right of MapperProxy
      从methodCache缓存中
      获取MapperMethodInvoker
      使用MapUtil.computeIfAbsent()自动缓存
      避免重复创建
    end note

    alt 缓存中不存在
        MapperProxy -> MapperMethod: new MapperMethod(mapperInterface, method, config)
        note right of MapperProxy
          创建MapperMethod
          - 解析方法签名
          - 判断SQL命令类型
          - 创建ParamNameResolver
        end note
        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: MapperMethod
        note right of MapperProxy
          使用MapUtil.computeIfAbsent()
          自动放入缓存
        end note
    end

    MapperProxy -> MapperMethod: execute(sqlSession, args)
    note right of MapperProxy
      执行Mapper方法
      传入SqlSession和参数
    end note
    activate MapperMethod

    alt SELECT操作
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: selectOne/selectList/selectMap/select/executeForCursor
        note right of SqlSession
          根据返回类型选择
          - selectOne: 返回单条
          - selectList: 返回列表
          - selectMap: 返回Map
          - executeForCursor: 返回Cursor
        end note
        activate SqlSession

        SqlSession -> CachingExec: query(...)
        note right of CachingExec
          进入查询流程
          参考SQL执行时序图
        end note
        activate CachingExec

        CachingExec -> Executor: (执行查询流程，参考SQL执行时序图)
        note right of Executor
          详细流程:
          1. CachingExecutor处理二级缓存
          2. BaseExecutor处理一级缓存
          3. SimpleExecutor执行SQL
          4. ResultSetHandler映射结果
        end note
        Executor --> CachingExec: results
        deactivate CachingExec

        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: results
        note right of MapperMethod
          结果转换在executeForMany/executeForMap/executeForCursor
          内部自动完成
        end note
        deactivate SqlSession

        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: return value

    else INSERT操作
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: insert(statement, param)
        note right of SqlSession
          执行插入操作
        end note
        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: rows
        note right of MapperMethod
          返回影响行数
        end note
        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: return value

    else UPDATE操作
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: update(statement, param)
        note right of SqlSession
          执行更新操作
        end note
        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: rows
        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: return value

    else DELETE操作
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: delete(statement, param)
        note right of SqlSession
          执行删除操作
        end note
        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: rows
        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: return value

    else FLUSH操作
        MapperMethod -> SqlSession: flushStatements()
        note right of SqlSession
          执行批处理刷新
        end note
        SqlSession --> MapperMethod: batchResults
        MapperMethod --> MapperProxy: return value

    end

    deactivate MapperMethod
end

MapperProxy --> User: return value
deactivate MapperProxy

@enduml
